    "created_at": "2016-07-14T00:08:35Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-14T00:08:35Z",
    "body": "In general this algorithm is only used in this spec when one of the arguments is known to be in the ASCII range (e.g. from a predefined set). We might have accidentally used it elsewhere though. What web-exposed behavior does this bug report reflect?\n",
