    "created_at": "2016-07-18T13:12:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-18T13:12:37Z",
    "body": "I think we also use this in some legacy contexts where what you state here is not necessarily the case? And I think we were planning on also using this for radio groupings instead of the current Unicode requirement which was rather messy.\n\nNote that we generally don't care about Unicode normalization at the platform level. It's assumed that developers normalize all their input in the same way. We don't really handle differences for them in any API.\n\n(Added this to the PR by accident. Probably better here.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
