    "created_at": "2016-07-19T04:26:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-07-19T04:26:23Z",
    "body": "One issue with normalization is that everyone assumes that someone else has normalized. Also, innocent-seeming things like string concatenation can produce non-normalized strings.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
